  "name": "Quest target respawn caps apply to real world spawns from their classes",
  "contract": "With the defaults Respawn.QuestTarget.Named 150, General 0 and LongRespawn 358 and the respawn timer starting at death, a real world spawn respawns at its database delay except a unique named quest target whose delay is at most 358 s, which respawns after 150 s. Hogger 448 (spawn 80531, elite, 180 s) is saved at death with 150 s. Garrick Padfoot 103 (spawn 80247, 270 s) saves 150 s from death when its corpse goes 60 s later. King Mukla 1559 (spawn 823, elite, 360 s) keeps 360 s. Defias Rogue Wizard 474 (spawn 80383, 270 s) is flagged but has 46 spawns, so it is a general target and keeps 270 s.",
